<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Donation receipt | CareCycle</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/requests.css"><script src="/app-nav.js" defer></script></head><body>
<%- include('partials/app-nav', { activePage: role === 'admin' ? 'admin-dashboard' : role + '-requests' }) %>
<main class="app-main pickup-page"><a href="/<%= role %>/<%= role === 'admin' ? 'dashboard' : 'requests' %>">Back to <%= role === 'admin' ? 'administration' : 'requests' %></a><h1 class="page-title">Donation receipt</h1>
<p>Receipts record actual NGO-acknowledged transfers. Downloads contain the recorded revision, with no pickup instructions or beneficiary summaries.</p>
<% if (message) { %><div class="request-message" role="status"><%= message %></div><% } %>
<% if (!latest) { %><section class="surface"><h2>Receipt not issued</h2><% if (canIssueReceipt(request)) { %><p>This completed request is eligible for a receipt.</p><% if (role !== 'admin') { %><form class="request-form" method="post" action="<%= base %>/issue"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="_version" value="0"><button type="submit">Issue donation receipt</button></form><% } else { %><p>A matched participant must issue the receipt. Administration access is read-only.</p><% } %><% } else { %><p>A receipt requires completed, reconciled handovers with NGO acknowledgement. Resolve remaining commitments and receipt discrepancies first. Older totals without confirmation evidence cannot create a receipt.</p><% } %></section><% } else { const receipt = request.receipt; const snapshot = latest.snapshot; %>
<section class="surface receipt-summary"><h2><%= receipt.reference %></h2><p>Current revision: <%= latest.number %>. Actual acknowledged quantity: <strong><%= snapshot.acknowledgedQuantity %></strong>. Released unfulfilled units: <%= snapshot.releasedQuantity %>.</p><p><%= snapshot.donorName %> to <%= snapshot.organizationName %>. Equipment: <%= snapshot.equipment %>.</p>
<p><a href="<%= base %>/document?revision=<%= latest.number %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open printable receipt / Save as PDF</a></p><p><a href="<%= base %>/download?revision=<%= latest.number %>">Download receipt (.html)</a></p><p>The download is a self-contained HTML file. Open it in a browser to print or save as PDF.</p></section>
<section class="surface"><h2>Recorded outcome</h2><p class="pickup-private"><%= snapshot.outcomeNote || 'No outcome note recorded.' %></p><p>An optional aggregate statement from the receiving NGO. Avoid names, phone numbers, addresses or other identifying beneficiary details.</p>
<% if (role === 'ngo' && !receipt.amendment) { %><form class="request-form" method="post" action="<%= base %>/outcome"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="_version" value="<%= receipt.version %>"><div class="pickup-field"><label for="outcome-note">Aggregate use or outcome note (optional)</label><textarea id="outcome-note" name="outcomeNote" maxlength="500" rows="4"><%= snapshot.outcomeNote %></textarea></div><label class="pickup-check"><input type="checkbox" name="aggregateOnly" value="yes" required> This note contains no identifying beneficiary details or unsupported claims.</label><button type="submit">Save outcome as new revision</button></form><% } %></section>
<section class="surface"><h2>Receipt corrections</h2><p>Receipt name corrections require both matched participants' agreement. Quantities, equipment and confirmation dates come from handover records and cannot be edited here.</p>
<% if (receipt.amendment) { const amendment = receipt.amendment; %><p>Proposed by the <%= amendment.actorRole === 'ngo' ? 'NGO' : 'donor' %>: donor <strong><%= amendment.donorName %></strong>, organization <strong><%= amendment.organizationName %></strong>.</p><p class="pickup-private"><%= amendment.reason %></p><p>The published receipt stays unchanged until the other participant confirms.</p>
<% if (role !== 'admin') { const action = amendment.actorRole === role ? 'withdraw' : 'confirm'; %><form class="request-form" method="post" action="<%= base %>/<%= action %>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="_version" value="<%= receipt.version %>"><div class="pickup-field"><label for="correction-reason">Correction confirmation or withdrawal reason</label><textarea id="correction-reason" name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" rows="3" required></textarea></div><label class="pickup-check"><input type="checkbox" name="aggregateOnly" value="yes" required> These receipt details are accurate and contain no identifying beneficiary information.</label><button type="submit"><%= action === 'confirm' ? 'Confirm correction as new revision' : 'Withdraw correction proposal' %></button></form><% } %>
<% } else if (role !== 'admin') { %><form class="request-form" method="post" action="<%= base %>/amend"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="_version" value="<%= receipt.version %>"><label for="receipt-donor">Donor name on receipt<input id="receipt-donor" name="donorName" value="<%= snapshot.donorName %>" minlength="2" maxlength="80" required></label><label for="receipt-organization">Organization name on receipt<input id="receipt-organization" name="organizationName" value="<%= snapshot.organizationName %>" minlength="2" maxlength="150" required></label><div class="pickup-field"><label for="amendment-reason">Reason for receipt correction</label><textarea id="amendment-reason" name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" rows="3" required></textarea></div><label class="pickup-check"><input type="checkbox" name="aggregateOnly" value="yes" required> These corrections contain no identifying beneficiary details or unsupported claims.</label><button type="submit">Propose receipt correction</button></form><% } %></section>
<section class="surface"><h2>Receipt revisions</h2><ol><% receipt.revisions.forEach(revision => { %><li><strong>Revision <%= revision.number %></strong>, <%= new Date(revision.at).toISOString() %> (UTC). <%= revision.reason %> <a href="<%= base %>/document?revision=<%= revision.number %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View revision <%= revision.number %></a> <a href="<%= base %>/download?revision=<%= revision.number %>">Download revision <%= revision.number %></a></li><% }) %></ol></section>
<section class="surface pickup-history"><h2>Receipt activity</h2><ol><% receipt.events.forEach(event => { %><li><strong><%= event.action.replaceAll('_', ' ') %></strong> by the <%= event.actorRole === 'ngo' ? 'NGO' : 'donor' %>, <%= new Date(event.at).toISOString() %> (UTC).<p class="pickup-private"><%= event.reason %></p></li><% }) %></ol></section>
<% } %></main></body></html>
